      "settings": {
        "back_text": "Back",
        "custom_title": "Air-Lift Round Stool - 31100",
        "intro_highlight": "Crafted for professional aesthetic environments, the Air-Lift Round Stool 31100 provides reliable comfort and mobility, prioritizing practitioner ergonomics and uncompromising stability. Designed for intensive daily use, this round stool without a backrest allows professionals to maintain an optimal working posture and seamless mobility across treatment rooms.",
        "custom_description": "<p>The Air-Lift Round Stool 31100 is purpose-built for licensed professionals, including Estheticians, Clinical Spa Technicians, and Massage Therapists. Its pneumatic height adjustment ranges smoothly from 20.5\" to 27.5\", adapting effortlessly to all workstations and treatment tables. Featuring an ultra-resistant leatherette and ultra-quiet casters, it ensures secure stability and frictionless 360-degree mobility throughout demanding schedules.</p>",
        "subtitle": "Pneumatic Air-Lift Height & 360° Mobility",
        "secondary_description": "<p>Unrivaled durability is central to the Equipro approach. To preserve the aesthetic quality and structural integrity of the 31100 Air-Lift Stool, perform regular sanitation with non-abrasive products formulated for professional environments weekly. The heavy-duty stain-resistant base and premium vinyl upholstery ensure an as-new professional appearance across years of heavy usage.</p>",
        "show_variant_selectors": true,
        "show_color_option": true,
        "show_size_option": false,
        "featured_product": "air-lift-round-stool-31100",
        "btn_label": "ADD TO CART",
        "show_compare_btn": true,
        "compare_btn_label": "Compare with other models"
      }
    },
    "main_product_characteristics_Hp7Baq": {
      "type": "main-product-characteristics",
      "blocks": {
        "faq_item_mcpNpt": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "For the Clinical Aesthetician:",
            "answer": "<p>The 31100 stool provides a stable, 360-degree swivel foundation essential for performing high-precision laser or injectable treatments. The ultra-quiet casters allow for seamless movement around the patient without disrupting the clinical workflow, while the air-lift mechanism ensures the practitioner remains at the optimal focal height to reduce neck and shoulder fatigue.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_74hYTC": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "For the Skincare Specialist:",
            "answer": "<p>During intensive facial procedures, maintaining a neutral spinal position is critical. The 20.5\" to 27.5\" height adjustability allows the specialist to transition effortlessly between high-seated positions and lower extraction angles. This adaptability directly translates to increased focus on technique and improved client outcomes through steady, fatigue-free hand movements.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_bhzmwM": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "For the Tattoo Artist or Body Tech:",
            "answer": "<p>Engineered for longevity, the industrial-grade steel base and ultra-resistant leatherette withstand the demands of long-duration sessions. The stain-resistant finish ensures that the workspace remains hygienic and professional even in high-use environments, providing a reliable seating solution that supports the technician’s posture throughout eight-hour shifts.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
